    "title": "Sterile Compounding & the Types of Medications We Provide",
    "description": "Wondering what is sterile compounding and what makes a sterile compounding pharmacy different from other pharmacies? We are certainly unique from other area pharmacies because of our sterile compounding lab.",
    "body": "What Is A Sterile Compounding Pharmacy?\nWondering what is sterile compounding and what makes a sterile compounding pharmacy different from other pharmacies? We are certainly unique from other area pharmacies because of our sterile compounding lab. We have the ability to make medications from scratch in a clean and safe environment. This means we can create personalized doses and alternative delivery methods such as troches, sublingual drops, injections, creams, and more. We adhere to the highest industry standards to ensure our medications are free from any contaminants and improve medication safety and adherence for our customers.\nWhat Compounded Medications Are Available?\nHere at our local Sulphur Springs pharmacy, we provide a wide range of personalized prescription medications for both men and women. Here are a few types of compounded medications we offer:\nGLP-1medications– Tirzepatide injections and both injectable and sublingual semaglutide for weight loss\nWomen’s sexual health– A libido-enhancing cream that heightens sexual pleasure and arousal by increasing blood flow to the applied area\nMen’s sexual health– Sildenafil, the active ingredient in brand-name erectile dysfunction medication in troche form, an oral tablet designed to dissolve slowly for faster absorption\nHair growth– A topical solution of Minoxidil and Finasteride which can combat hair loss and thinning\nLow Dose Naltrexone (LDN)– A treatment option for Fibromyalgia, Multiple Sclerosis, Crohn’s disease, chronic pain, and other conditions that may help relieve symptoms.\nHormone Replacement Therapy– Restores balance to hormone levels using bioidentical hormones sourced from plants\nThis is by no means an exhaustive list of compounded prescriptions we can create in our sterile compounding lab. Reach out to us today regarding our other dermatological topical solutions, veterinary and wound care products, and more!\nNeed A Compounded Medication Prescription?\nWe have proudly partnered with XpediCare to provide simple online assessments in order to receive a personalized prescription based on your unique needs. Here’s how it works:\nXpediCare Online Assessment: You can schedule a telemedicine consultation and speak with a telemedicine provider that same day.\nMedical Review: the XpediCare medical team will review your health assessment and reach out for any further information if necessary.\nPickup At Cody Drug. Your compounded prescription will be sent to our pharmacy and be ready for pickup swiftly. The consultation fee is already included in the price of your medication, so there are no hidden costs or additional fees.\nFollow-up visits are also available should any questions or concerns arise, and you can speak with a medical professional via the secure messaging or video chat portal. All online systems are HIPPA-compliant and confidential. And of course, our pharmacy experts are only a phone call away!\nAre you interested in learning more about how our sterile compounding services could benefit you? Read more about the medicine compounding options available at Cody Drug and reach out when you’re ready to get started. We look forward to helping you take control of your health!",
