    "body": "Our family-owned pharmacy is unique in many ways, from creating custom compounded medications to providing our community with top-quality supplements and wellness products. We understand that the supplement industry can be confusing and overwhelming, which is why we have created The Better Box. Keep reading to learn more about this better way to take daily supplements!\nWhat is The Better Box?\nHere at Cody Drug, we firmly believe that feeling your best shouldn’t be a luxury, but the standard. The Better Box is our way of covering the basics when it comes to supplements, which means it’s a great “beginner” pack to get you started, or you can easily incorporate it into your current supplement routine. We have gotten great feedback from customers saying that they can notice a difference in how they feel after a few consistent weeks of use!\nWhat’s included in The Better Box?\n1. Omega Max\nMaxSimil® monoglyceride fish oil has a three times greater EPA+DHA absorption rate than an equivalent dose of other leading fish oils. Through the use of MaxSimil’s patented lipid absorption enhancement technology, the fish oil is absorption-ready and can be directly assimilated into the intestinal tract for maximum benefit. These Omega-3 fatty acids can:\nSupport cardiovascular health\nSupport brain function\nSupport healthy glucose metabolism\n2. D3+K2 Max\nNatural vitamin D3 and vitamin K2 in a water-soluble micellized form. Micellization greatly increases the solubility, absorption, and bioavailability. Vitamin K2 (MK7) supports enhanced utilization of calcium in the bloodstream. Combined with Vitamin D3, this formula can:\nSupport bone health\nSupport carboxylation of bone proteins\nSupports cardiovascular health and arterial elasticity\n3. Texas Tea\nThis supplement provides 100 mg of green tea leaf extract per capsule. Green tea supplements contain inherent polyphenols, which possess antioxidant activity and metabolic benefits. While most green tea products are usually poorly absorbed by the body, our liposomal formula ensures high absorption– over 8 times higher than non-liposomal green tea supplements!\nWho would benefit from taking daily supplements?\nOne of the best things about The Better Box is that nearly anyone can benefit! These are some of our best-selling supplements that offer value to your daily wellness routine and provide basic support for your overall health. As with any new supplement, it is always a good idea to speak with a healthcare professional before starting anything new. If you are worried about a product reacting with one of your prescription medications, feel free to let us know about your concerns. We can provide insight and recommendations based on your specific needs.\nNow that you know more about the better way to take daily supplements, take the first step towards better health today. Stop by to get yours in-store or purchase The Better Box online! Have a question? Don’t hesitate to reach out– our friendly staff are happy to help in person or over the phone.",
    "image": "assets/provider-blog-posts/52-introducing-the-better-box-a-better-way-to-take-daily-supplements-cb29dd7.webp",
